# Open Design daemon auto-start compatibility configuration
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your local Open Design repository path.
#
# integrations.openDesign in settings.json is the recommended persistent
# configuration. These variables remain supported for `dscode --with-od` and
# are used only when typed Open Design settings are absent.
# The compatibility loader reads only the two Open Design variables below.
# Do not put these names in a settings.json `env` object: MCP server `env`
# values configure only that MCP child process.

# Path to the Open Design repository on this machine
# Example: ~/Workspace/DeepSeekSpace/open-design
# OPEN_DESIGN_DIR=~/path/to/open-design

# Port for the Open Design daemon (default: 7456)
# OD_PORT=7456
